Your **Display Picture (DP)** is the first thing buyers and artists see on your profile — so make it count! Updating it is quick and easy.

## **Steps to change your display picture:**

1.  1\. Go to your ****Settings****
    
    ![1\. Go to your Settings](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-07-01-004741.png)
    
     
2.  Click on the **Studio Setup** tab
3.  Click on the ****Profile Picture****
    
    ![Click on the Profile Picture](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-07-01-005536.png)
    
     
4.  Choose your image from your device
5.  Click **Submit**

Your new DP will be updated instantly across the platform.

## **Tips for a Great DP:**

-   Use a **clear, high-quality image**
-   Avoid logos with text that's too small to read
-   Show your face or brand identity — it builds trust!
